{"id":4739,"name":"Arne no Jikenbo","slug":"arne_no_jikenbo","synopsis":"Arne Neuntöte is a vampire detective who manipulates supernatural powers. Lynn Reinweiß is a nobleman’s daughter who loves vampires. Their worlds should never have crossed, but they join hands to solve a bloody mystery.\n\nIn the darkest of nights, Lynn finds herself in desperate need of help. Then she wanders into the mysterious city of \"Lügenberg\", where non-humans live. Lynn's world changes drastically when she encounters \"Arne\", a vampire who is called \"the worst\" in the city. And tonight, a new \"murder case\" has occurred. What is the truth behind the bizarre incidents that take place in a world where humanity and the bizarre intersect?\n\n\"Come on, human. You may dance merrily under the crimson moon.”\n\n(Source: AniList)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2026,"createdAt":"2026-01-09 02:39:25","updatedAt":"2026-01-09 02:39:25","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":183984},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18967},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":49323},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":12908},{"site":"MAL","externalId":60255},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":33926}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":13090,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/jLt3rTF7FxyQdxv9eXy1K9X3ZhIbLPzvULdjbo2W.avif"},{"id":13091,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/jIiE4w3JwfwkakZ4WdTklrJ3gD4h1LnUgiMedncf.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":59,"name":"SILVER LINK.","slug":"silver_link"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":14153,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":14066,"title":"Q.E.D.","titleNative":"Q.E.D."},"animethemeentries":[{"id":16565,"version":1,"episodes":"1, 11","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":19321,"basename":"ArneNoJikenbo-OP1.webm","filename":"ArneNoJikenbo-OP1","link":"https://